  "description": "Integration-test your data layer against real MSSQL and PostgreSQL databases. A Testcontainers-backed SQLFixture with pluggable schema provisioning (dacpac / raw scripts / delegate, e.g. EF migrations) and Respawn-based reset. ORM-agnostic — serves Dapper and EF alike. Reference from test projects only; not needed at runtime in production assemblies.",
